  "commentary": [
    {"t":0,"text":"The Dutch keeping it, nice and patiently, in midfield."},
    {"t":2.2,"text":"Out to Mühren, wide on the left."},
    {"t":4.6,"text":"Mühren's got time here, looking for a target…"},
    {"t":6.2,"text":"Hangs it up high towards the far side…"},
    {"t":7.6,"text":"Van Basten waiting out on the right, surely too wide…"},
    {"t":8.4,"text":"Van Basten's hit it first time!"},
    {"t":9.15,"text":"IT'S IN! Over Dasayev from there! That is absolutely outrageous!"},
    {"t":10.5,"text":"An impossible angle, in a final. You won't see a better volley."}
  ],
  "venue": {"time":"day","roof":"partial","stands":"#8e9196","accent":"#b9c6cc","track":true,"grass":"#3f8a3c","mowing":"stripes"},
  "analysis": [
    {"label":"Context","text":"The Netherlands led 1–0 early in the second half. The USSR had to keep men forward, and patient Dutch possession in midfield let the move reach the left flank unhurried."},
    {"label":"Build-up","text":"Mühren had time on the left to look up. Rather than crossing for the near post, Mühren hung the ball high towards the far side, well beyond the Soviet defenders guarding the goal area."},
    {"label":"Why it worked","text":"Van Basten stayed wide on the right, level with the six-yard box. From there the angle looked too tight to be a threat, so no defender was drawn across to close the space."},
    {"label":"The finish","text":"A first-time volley gave Dasayev no moment to adjust position. Struck across the goal, the ball rose over the keeper and dropped into the far top corner for 2–0."}
  ],
